[{"id":2788,"name":"元宵赠好礼","level":0,"simpleDesc":"","desc":"正月是农历的元月，古人称夜为“宵”，所以称正月十五为元宵节。正月十五是一年中第一个月圆之夜，也是一元复始，大地回春的夜晚，人们对此加以庆祝，也是庆贺新春的延续。元宵节又称为“上元节”。中国民间有过元宵节吃元宵的习俗。元宵由糯米制成，或实心，或带馅。馅有豆沙、白糖、山楂、各类果料等，食用时煮、煎、蒸、炸皆可。起初，人们把这种食物叫“浮圆子”，后来又叫“汤团”或“汤圆”，这些名称与“团圆”字音相近，取团圆之意，象征全家人团团圆圆，和睦幸福，人们也以此怀念离别的亲人,寄托了对未来生活的美好愿望。  ","setting":2,"mapId":19,"npcId":13,"radarMapID":0,"dialogNotStartNotReady":"50级以上角色才能参加活动哦。","dialogStartNotFinish":"","dialogStartFinish":"在这元宵佳节，我们一起分享美味的汤圆。汤圆上虽然不会显示日期，不过小心哦，这些汤圆会过期的。趁早吃。不然坏肚子就不好了。","exp":0,"money2":0,"money3":0,"rewardItems":[{"illusion":[],"id":821,"quantity":1,"name":"元宵汤圆盒","bagIcon":7,"grade":3}],"acceptCondition":[{"type":1,"typeName":"CONDITION_LEVEL","not":0,"rawHex":"32","minimum":50},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""}],"submitCondition":[{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""},{"type":0,"typeName":"CONDITION_NONE","not":0,"rawHex":""}],"type":0,"series":"","acceptMapId":19,"acceptNpcId":13,"canAccept":1,"_isHelp":false,"wireBase64":"","sources":[{"seq":6148,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a","blob":"blobs/81/81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a.bin","npcId":13,"mapId":19},{"capture":"2026-09-19T23-46-03-133Z_d6e6ad","seq":6148,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a","blob":"blobs/81/81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a.bin","npcId":13,"mapId":19},{"capture":"2026-09-20T23-27-15-970Z_874aae","seq":81422,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a","blob":"blobs/81/81b5677cca0d037d9804452654d992c6c0490cac9d5cac9f63ac777c1f60d75a.bin","npcId":13,"mapId":19},{"capture":"2026-09-20T23-27-15-970Z_874aae","seq":84566,"protocol":14501,"sha256":"81b5677cca0d037d9804452654